~ start
if quest_complete()
	Minerva The Witch: That mushroom was exactly what these old bones needed. Thank you, Coren.
	Minerva The Witch: Now go on, before Saberhagen starts judging you too.
	=> END
elif quest_started() and has_items()
	Minerva The Witch: Is that my mushroom? Oh, you're a dear. Hand it here.
	if turn_in()
		Minerva The Witch: Wonderful. Take this for your trouble, {{reward_text()}}.
		Minerva The Witch: And don't tell the boys I spoil you.
	=> END
elif quest_started()
	Minerva The Witch: It only grows in that one quiet place, deep in the forest. You know the one.
	=> waiting
	
else
	=> offer

~ offer
Minerva The Witch: Oh, look. Another glorious morning. Makes me sick! (Minerva giggles)
Minerva The Witch: Good morning, Coren. I'm afraid I need my mushroom today.
=> choices

~ choices
- I'll get your mushroom.
	if start_quest()
		Minerva The Witch: Bless you. Don't eat it on the way, it's not that kind of mushroom.
	=> END
- Sick?
	Minerva The Witch: Not me, dear. Chaunt.
	Minerva The Witch: He came in this morning trembling. He wouldn't tell me what happened, so I brewed him an elixir to relax his mind.
	Minerva The Witch: He'd been running, and said he couldn't get me my mushroom.
	Minerva The Witch: That boy. Forty-some years old and he still comes running to me when he's scared.
	=> choices
- Not right now.
	Minerva The Witch: That's alright, I'll be here. Where else would an old witch go?
	=> END
	
~ waiting
- Sick?
	Minerva The Witch: Not me, dear. Chaunt.
	Minerva The Witch: He came in this morning trembling. He wouldn't tell me what happened, so I brewed him an elixir to relax his mind.
	Minerva The Witch: He'd been running, and said he couldn't get me my mushroom.
	Minerva The Witch: That boy. Forty-some years old and he still comes running to me when he's scared.
	=> waiting
- Mushroom?
	Minerva The Witch: No mushroom yet? That's alright. I'm old, not impatient.
	Minerva The Witch: ...Well. A little impatient. (Minerva giggles)
	Minerva The Witch: I'm sorry, Coren. I know what it costs you to go there.
	Minerva The Witch: Nothing else grows that well in this forest. I suppose the soil there is... well cared for.
	Minerva The Witch: Leave a flower for her while you're there.
	=> END
- Leave.
	=> END